# Netlify redirects
#
# ── Block internal files (forced 404 — "!" shadows files that exist in the deploy) ──
# Netlify _redirects cannot wildcard by extension (/*.py is not supported),
# so sensitive files are enumerated. Splats only work on path segments (/docs/*).
# These files remain public on GitHub by design; they are blocked here because
# the Netlify mirror serves the whole repo (publish = "." in netlify.toml).

